# Tests for the case beside this file.

tripleTest is test
tripleTest purpose "Three times four is twelve"
tripleTest verifies triple timesThree
tripleTest typeParam none
tripleTest input none
tripleTest output none
tripleTest outputOwner none
tripleTest raises none
tripleTest effect none
tripleTest uses none
tripleTest memory heap false
tripleTest async false
tripleTest maxRecursion none
tripleTest label begin loopKind none
tripleTest label begin within none
tripleTest let four immutable Int64 4
tripleTest let twelve immutable Int64 12
tripleTest let thirteen immutable Int64 13
tripleTest at begin do runTriple
tripleTest at begin do expectResult
tripleTest at begin return ok none

runTriple is call
runTriple in tripleTest
runTriple invokes triple
runTriple arg value Int64 four copy
runTriple out result Int64
runTriple ownedBy none
runTriple cleanedBy none
runTriple borrows none
runTriple catch none

expectResult is call
expectResult in tripleTest
expectResult invokes test.assertEqualInt64
expectResult arg expected Int64 twelve copy
expectResult arg actual Int64 result copy
expectResult out none
expectResult ownedBy none
expectResult cleanedBy none
expectResult borrows none
expectResult catch none
